WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:04.580
I am here now.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:06.980
Because of you.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:10.700
You created me.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:14.420
And for that

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.400
I bless you.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:49.880
Move! Move!

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:51.000
Move!

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:51.720
Move!

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:55.460
And tell me story.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:57.460
Tell me.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:00:59.640
Every detail.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:06.300
I woke up.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.900
from where?

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.100
From a nightmare.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:09.680
What was it about?

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.220
Then?

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:16.060
Then, me and lots took care of their business.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.680
Hold up! Hold up! Back up!

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:22.720
Do you left something out?

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.280
Are you writing a book?

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.020
They all lived hapilly ever after.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.120
No, they didn't know that.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:33.600
Because for the first time there is something you don't know.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.200
Something nobody told you.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.940
You wanted the prophecy!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.400
This is your prophecy.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.640
I don't come with manual.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.800
I know your story.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:17.860
Behold!

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.900
The man who pulled sword from stone.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.720
I'm not getting drown into this mess.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:25.660
There's an army of you.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:26.900
There's only one of me.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:27.620
I'll talk.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.580
Happy to talk.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.360
But there is no way

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.500
that i'm fighting.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:05.740
So what happens now?

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.120
You know what happens now.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.480
You're quickly becoming a legend.

